8f062ca86d4e-1024x569.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧頌恩 臥底旅行團 （圖片來源：J2《十人巷》片段）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"533\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/edwqmvdzt61f0z-txdwa8jsv5yissnrtgwuerrlrhk0_185770291268f062ca86d4e-1024x569.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：J2《十人巷》片段）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/iqruajhheq_d7fmwru1ca-ajbfchprw6fdvh3x3vyd0-1_201878523368f062cc6066b-1024x570.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧頌恩 臥底旅行團 （圖片來源：J2《十人巷》片段）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"534\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/iqruajhheq_d7fmwru1ca-ajbfchprw6fdvh3x3vyd0-1_201878523368f062cc6066b-1024x570.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：J2《十人巷》片段）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176058345957081360_156437153668f05f23ee603.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧頌恩 臥底旅行團 2人合作多年！（圖片來源：新傳媒資料庫）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1000\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176058345957081360_156437153668f05f23ee603.jpg\" width=\"1000\"/></a><figcaption>2人合作多年！（圖片來源：新傳媒資料庫）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176058346090687578_43179849868f05f2536a41.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧頌恩 臥底旅行團 有網民希望有線兩大台柱阿正同妹頭擔正做新劇主角。（圖片來源：HOYTV）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"580\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176058346090687578_43179849868f05f2536a41.jpg\" width=\"725\"/></a><figcaption>有網民希望有線兩大台柱阿正同妹頭擔正做新劇主角。（圖片來源：HOYTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176058346155170578_24127695068f05f25cb5e9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"盧頌恩 臥底旅行團 李尚正和妹頭主持的《臥底旅行團》為HOYTV的皇牌節目。（圖片來源：《臥底旅行團》截圖）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/176058346155170578_24127695068f05f25cb5e9.jpg\" width=\"1185\"/></a><figcaption>李尚正和妹頭主持的《臥底旅行團》為HOYTV的皇牌節目。（圖片來源：《臥底旅行團》截圖）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T11:21:54.509262+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1724,"images":14,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T10:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:58:45.740367+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:53.817806+00:00","content_hash":"1fb75b0db3150e4d2128829d25b2490f73e07967b1d33b12be784b7dee801cb9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}